; THE GREAT LIBRARY (sunspire.library) - the Veiled Archive's great library, the Act III/IV story hub.
; Authored in the cell's CONTENT frame and moved to Cell.origin by tools/shift_cell_content.py.
;
; WARNING THE FORECOURT IS RESERVED. PaleConcordPortalAnchor and CelestialPortalAnchor are EMPTY markers
; where the main-line integrator places two story portals. Keep them, keep the court clear (the scatter
; exclusion Exclusion_library_court covers it), and put nothing interactive between them.
;
; The hall is ENTERABLE (tools/compose_building.py great_library 3 5 2 --hollow --wall-family stone
; --door-index 1): door on its south face, the Archivist inside at the reading desk.

