; CAMPAIGN (WR-spec2-06..11, 24, 44, 45 and the map location location.sunspire.deep_stacks): ACT III'S VAULT.
; THE DEEP STACKS is a walled court sunk behind the great hall. The ground does the work: the library's pad stands 1.8 m
; above a natural basin to its north (generated ground, x -262..-238, z 1437..1456), whose far side climbs into the mesa, so
; the court's floor rises gently north (0.11) and the way in is a short drop behind the hall's back wall. The door slab is
; the court's south gate (hidden by flag.beat.stacks_open, collision with it); four ruin-wall runs and six pillars close the
; rest. Inside: the three seal plinths in a triangle (ring intact until its plinth flag, cracked after), the codex lectern at
; the centre (the map pin), the two set pieces and, beyond the plinths, the Ashen Knight once the vault is held.
; Court interior (cell-local): x 35..55, z -65.4..-81.4, centre (45, -73.4).

